2:T500,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the best free productivity app in India?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"PlanBot offers the best free tier for AI planning (2 AI plans/day). Combined with free Anki and free Notion, you get a complete productivity system at zero cost."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which productivity app is best for JEE preparation?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"PlanBot is specifically designed for competitive exam preparation. Its Student persona creates study plans optimized for exams like JEE, NEET, GATE, and UPSC. Combined with Anki for revision, it's the ultimate JEE stack."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are there any Indian-made productivity apps?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. PlanBot is built by PlannextTech, an Indian company. It's designed for Indian users with ₹ pricing, UPI-friendly subscriptions, and goal templates for Indian competitive exams."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which app is better — Todoist or PlanBot?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"They serve different purposes. Todoist is a task recorder — you create tasks manually. PlanBot is an AI planner — the AI creates your entire daily plan."}}]}a:["slug","best-productivity-apps-india-2026","d"]
